From dbed72f21ef6da0c018d638e2f09bbcb91fa412e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy Lutomirski <luto@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:05:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] capabilities: ambient capabilities

Upstream commit 58319057b7847667f0c9585b9de0e8932b0fdb08 (v4.3), applied
to Amazon's 4.1.15 with offsets only (include/linux/cred.h with fuzz 2).
Android 8.1 init and its services use PR_CAP_AMBIENT; Readom carries the
same feature for PW3 as patch 1050, backported to 3.0.35.
